    "standardized_narrative": "In 2022, Syndicate 2623 reported a net release of $42.6 million in prior year reserves. This release was primarily driven by favorable claims development in Digital, MAP Risks, and Property Risks divisions, partially offset by strengthening in Cyber Risks and Speciality Risks. The 2020 year of account was adversely impacted by COVID-19 pandemic losses and natural catastrophes like Hurricanes Ida, Laura, and Storm Uri. The 2021 year of account was affected by the war in Ukraine and natural catastrophes including Hurricanes Ida, Laura, Storm Uri, Ian, Elliot, various flooding catastrophes, and the Volker hail event.",
